- 3 default AlertRules: http_5xx>1%, llm_timeout>10%, grading_failure>5%
- 5-minute dedup per rule
- Feishu webhook + SMTP email notification channels (env-configured)
- Alert records logged to logs/alerts.log (JSON lines)
- /api/admin/alerts endpoint for rule status + recent alerts

